 státu-as sl-lis hoc peccá-tum. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-85c052d6-6042-43e4-a217-b5c183ab6345" facs="#m-7144a7cc-c4e3-4f09-ad4c-6f5c80f8a965" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-de8d3069-ac9d-4297-a6b7-e083613389f8" facs="#m-c3c241d0-bb54-47f4-bbd5-cf3ed7762a25" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-974a16f9-ce09-49c9-8b29-3e7362cff813" facs="#m-8a18cd0a-6478-4d4d-9d39-4af5bfcc3bd3" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-11a54feb-31d5-4444-9b31-9030050ada6b" facs="#m-15ffc06c-a36d-4870-a921-2c91bc6060d6" label="lyrics-like">Apides torréntes sl-li “dúlces fu-é-runt: spsum</l><l xml:id="m-f19a6c7c-9b50-4de3-8d17-aaf485d0cff9" facs="#m-be575b67-21e2-4e0b-98ee-f05cdc7ca7de" label="lyrics-like">sequúntur ómnes á-nimae jústae.</l><l xml:id="m-dbb370ff-57fe-4a15-abc3-c8a7c2509274" facs="#m-bfa21633-5e42-4b6e-9920-0ff2dbb6fd67" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-f2d5a733-c608-4906-bfa0-406ef826bfaf" facs="#m-fea83846-d380-4631-8bf0-d30c4721665d" label="ambiguous">s. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-9d210966-7f3b-48d3-814e-0f03900d8666" facs="#m-b3d86cce-881d-4d90-b23d-c9aa1e9f2ae1" label="ambiguous">3.6</l><l xml:id="m-6c3f2a51-7c92-4a62-9fed-ee7f8f99c27e" facs="#m-afe6712c-61cf-46ee-b818-df6eb699473f" label="lyrics-like">Dhaésit“ ánima mé-a post te, qui-a cá-ro</l><l xml:id="m-6885b5e8-8be7-4ba1-bde4-5ba6a2f59324" facs="#m-fb056659-71d4-4cb6-a6c8-7de80ec42f65" label="lyrics-like">mé-a lapidá-ta est pro te, Dé-us mé-us. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-f4d0111a-3b5e-4846-b2fb-2014960433d7" facs="#m-4bbf4d82-c8ae-4d05-bd5a-0ef35ef0004c" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-1839841c-13dd-45d3-a788-e73a0cefaa80" facs="#m-70533e38-d684-4a70-9102-988b03d5917f" label="lyrics-like">Téphanus“ ví-dit caélos apértos, vídit, et intro-i¬</l><l xml:id="m-fc1e2b30-2422-4b7d-a688-7aa1c14fc775" facs="#m-c45326d6-363c-445c-bafb-c54efc09878a" label="lyrics-like">vit : be- átus hómo, cú-i caéli paté-bant. E u o u a e.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
